values ('ap_physics_c_em', 8, '8.2', array['8.2']::text[], 'convention', 'Conservation of charge', 'Any change in a system''s net charge is due to a transfer of charge (typically electrons) between the system and its surroundings; otherwise the net charge stays constant.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-physics-c-em-reference-u8-u10-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_physics_c_em-u8-r1-011; ced=8.2.A.2 "Any change to a system''s net charge is due to a transfer of charge"; 8.2.A.2.ii')
